        ----------
        name
            Branch name (any supported kind from the table above).
        t
            Optional step selection (``int`` / ``slice`` / array-like).
            ``None`` returns the full per-sample trace.
        port
            Gyrator only: ``1`` or ``2`` (default ``2``, the branch).
        """
        ...
